@startuml
' Current-state ML Playground use-case diagram based on main-branch UI and API routes.
title ML Playground — Use Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F8F6FC
  BorderColor #4B3B7C
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4B3B7C
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #392C59
  FontColor #312547
}

actor "Platform User" as User
actor "Google OAuth Provider" as Google
actor "External REST API Client" as ApiClient
actor "Classroom Instructor" as Instructor
actor "Classroom Student" as Student

rectangle "ML Playground" {
  (Register, sign in and sign out) as UC_Account
  (Sign in with Google) as UC_Google
  (Upload CSV or load a ready-made example) as UC_Upload
  (Inspect dataset profile and data quality) as UC_Profile
  (Select features / target and get algorithm recommendations) as UC_ConfigureData
  (Configure and launch a training job) as UC_Train
  (Monitor or cancel training jobs) as UC_MonitorTraining
  (Review results, metrics, explainability and experiment comparisons) as UC_Results
  (Edit and execute Python pipeline code) as UC_Code
  (Use AI Copilot) as UC_Copilot
  (Read the ML Playground user guide) as UC_Guide
  (Manage model deployments) as UC_Deploy
  (Manage model registry and model versions) as UC_Registry
  (Monitor deployment status and drift) as UC_Drift
  (Request predictions through the REST API) as UC_Predict

  (Create classrooms and assignments) as UC_CreateClassroom
  (Manage classroom roster and invitations) as UC_Roster
  (Review submissions, grade work and export grades) as UC_Grade
  (Join a classroom or resume an exam) as UC_Join
  (Complete and submit lab work / exam) as UC_Submit
}

' Solid, undirected associations: actor-to-use-case relationships.
User -- UC_Account
User -- UC_Google
User -- UC_Upload
User -- UC_Profile
User -- UC_ConfigureData
User -- UC_Train
User -- UC_MonitorTraining
User -- UC_Results
User -- UC_Code
User -- UC_Copilot
User -- UC_Guide
User -- UC_Deploy
User -- UC_Registry
User -- UC_Drift
Google -- UC_Google
ApiClient -- UC_Predict
Instructor -- UC_CreateClassroom
Instructor -- UC_Roster
Instructor -- UC_Grade
Student -- UC_Join
Student -- UC_Submit

note bottom of UC_Predict
  Represents the API prediction capability exposed by the backend.
end note
@enduml
